{
  "category": "Fang Snake Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "SEVIPER shares a generations-long feud with ZANGOOSE. The scars on its body are evidence of vicious battles. This POKéMON attacks using its sword- edged tail.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "SEVIPER’s swordlike tail serves two purposes - it slashes foes and douses them with secreted poison. This POKéMON will not give up its long- running blood feud with ZANGOOSE.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "SEVIPER and ZANGOOSE are eternal rivals. It counters a ZANGOOSE’s dazzling agility with its swordlike tail, which also oozes a horrible poison.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It sharpens its swordlike tail on hard rocks. It hides in tall grass and strikes unwary prey with venomous fangs.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "It sharpens its swordlike tail on hard rocks. It hides in tall grass and strikes unwary prey with venomous fangs.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "For many generations, it has feuded with ZANGOOSE. It whets its bladed tail on rocks for battle.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
